WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.254 --> 00:00:04.087
(peaceful instrumental music)

00:00:06.114 --> 00:00:09.544
- [Voiceover] The town of Regent is dying.

00:00:09.544 --> 00:00:12.043
I said, if someone doesn't do something,

00:00:12.043 --> 00:00:15.376
this community will be a dead community.

00:00:16.730 --> 00:00:19.525
I have a paved road from
interstate to Regent.

00:00:19.525 --> 00:00:23.187
Now what do I do to bring
people down 30 miles?

00:00:24.205 --> 00:00:28.379
(peaceful instrumental music)

00:00:28.379 --> 00:00:31.345
Then it dawned on me, nobody
is gonna drive 30 miles

00:00:31.345 --> 00:00:32.909
for normal sculptures,

00:00:32.909 --> 00:00:36.659
but they might drive
for the world's largest.

00:00:39.237 --> 00:00:42.936
I started the Enchanted Highway in 1989.

00:00:42.936 --> 00:00:47.897
I've been at it for 28 years
and it takes me roughly about

00:00:47.897 --> 00:00:51.147
four to five years to do one sculpture.

00:00:56.307 --> 00:01:01.068
The first year, local ranchers
taught me how to weld.

00:01:01.068 --> 00:01:05.665
I put in eight hours a day
to get one sculpture done.

00:01:05.665 --> 00:01:09.500
I used old oil well tanks, I cut 'em open,

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:13.667
and I flatten it out and
that's 90% of my metal.

00:01:14.722 --> 00:01:17.472
It's a passion project right now.

00:01:20.128 --> 00:01:23.660
I started with the world's
largest tin family.

00:01:23.660 --> 00:01:27.513
The man is 45 feet tall,
the woman is 43 feet,

00:01:27.513 --> 00:01:29.430
and the boy is 23 feet.

00:01:30.638 --> 00:01:34.687
Geese in Flight has over 300
length of oil well pipe on,

00:01:34.687 --> 00:01:36.915
over 15 miles of weld on it,

00:01:36.915 --> 00:01:39.333
and is in the Guinness Book of Records,

00:01:39.333 --> 00:01:42.833
the world's largest scrap metal sculpture.

00:01:47.790 --> 00:01:51.894
It's something I will continue
on till I'm six feet under.

00:01:51.894 --> 00:01:55.144
Then I hope it continues on after that.

00:01:56.619 --> 00:01:59.106
I want people to see that this guy

00:01:59.106 --> 00:02:02.119
who didn't know how to weld,
didn't have an art class,

00:02:02.119 --> 00:02:04.284
if he can create something like this,

00:02:04.284 --> 00:02:06.367
I can do almost anything.

